  "clock": null,
  "touch": true
 },
 "check": {
  "describe": "A tap on the mini player at 0.1 s, captured 0.2 s later. Mid-morph: the card about two thirds of its expanded height and the art about 110 dp, moving to the centre, the title following below it. Settles to the full card with 150 dp art, title, artist and a progress bar. Resized (narrow 240, wide 540, captured settled at 1 s) the expanded card fills the width with the art centred, and the ProgressBar fills 40 % of whatever width it gets; the 288 dp card needs a host at least 320 dp tall. Mono looks have no motion: the card is already expanded.",
